    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 of the Excise (Special Provisions) Act, No. 13 of 1989, I, RaviKarunanayake, Minister of Finance, do by this Order declare that, the Excise duty on every article specified in theColumn II and III of the schedule hereto, corresponding to the every article specified under the following H. S. Headingsmentioned in the Column I of the Schedule of the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 1941/29 dated 20.11.2015issued under the Section 3 of this Act shall be payable at the rate specified in the corresponding entry in Column IV of theSchedule hereto, with effect from 20th August 2016.",
